        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Nebukadinezara wakapanga cikozyano cangolida. Bwiime bwaco bwakali tukokola tuli makumi aali musanu alimwi, abwaamba bwaco bwakali tukokola tuli musanu akamwi. Nkabela wakaciimika mugundu lya-Dura mucisi ca-Babuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Nebukadinezara wakatamba beendelezi bazisi abangambela abami abasinkuta abasimubambamali ababetesi abasikwiiminina abasilutwe boonse bazisi, kuti bazoobungane kukusalazya eco cikozyano mwami Nebukadinezara ncaakaimikide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
