        },
        {
          "text": "Pele kuli bamwi ba-Juda mbobikide mumilimo yacisi ca-Babuloni, nkokuti Sadrake, Mesaki a-Abedinego. Aba bantu tababiki myoyo yabo kumajwi aako, O mwami. Tabakombi baleza bako, acikozyano cangolida ncoimikide tabacikotamini pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
