        },
        {
          "text": "Amvwe obo, Nebukadinezara wakazula bukali, abusyu bwakwe bwakabija naakalanga ba-Sadrake a-Mesaki a-Abedinego. Wakalailila kuti ibbila lisoselwe ziindi zili musanu azibili kwiinda mbolyakali kuumpwa lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.19",
