          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakalailila bamwi bantu, baalumi basintaze bamumpi yakwe, kuti baange ba-Sadrake a-Mesaki a-Abedinego, babawaale mubbila lyamulilo wamabangabanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo aba bantu bakaangwa, kabasamine zikobela zyabo azibaki zyabo angowani zyabo azyakusama zyabo zyoonse, akuwaalwa mukati kabbila lyamulilo wamabangabanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nkaambo kabukali bwamajwi aamwami, alimwi nkaambo kakuti ibbila lyakayakisya loko, mabangabanga aamulilo akatenta abo bantu ibakatola ba-Sadrake a-Mesaki a-Abedinego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
