          "text": "Nkaambo kako ndabika mulao wakuti, akati kabantu bamisyobo yoonse amyaambo yoonse, kufumbwa muntu uuamba cakusampaula Leza waba-Sadrake a-Mesaki a-Abedinego uyoogonkelwa zizo zyakwe, aŋanda yakwe iyooba mafwisila, Nkaambo taakwe Leza umbi uukonzya kuvuna obo. ",
